# end of statement: FIRE test.t1_stmt (AFTER INSERT,UPDATE FOR EACH STATEMENT) over 1 INSERT, 0 UPDATE, 0 DELETE rows; true: INSERTING; subject TABLE open and locked: yes; body would run here: execute_trigger() as root@localhost, SUB_STMT_TRIGGER
