#
# A failing BEFORE COMMIT body at a commit rolls back the whole
# transaction, as the SQL standard has it for a COMMIT whose triggered
# actions fail, with SQLSTATE 40004.  The body's error stays as a
# further condition.  The statement that caused the commit does not
# run.  The injected failure is in the last trigger of t1's list, after
# the first two have fired.
#
