# end of statement: FIRE test.t14_u (AFTER UPDATE FOR EACH STATEMENT) over 0 INSERT, 1 UPDATE, 0 DELETE rows; true: UPDATING; subject TABLE open and locked: yes; body would run here: execute_trigger() as root@localhost, SUB_STMT_TRIGGER
